%N A401338 Number of ways to tile a size n staircase polyomino with squares of integer side lengths.
%C A401338 A size-n staircase polyomino is a polyomino consisting of n left-aligned rows in increasing length of 1, 2, ..., n.
%H A401338 Seiichi Manyama, <a href="/A401338/b401338.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..26</a>
